---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
eyebrow: Contact
subtitle: Send a message and I'll reply personally within one business day.
permalink: /contact/
narrow: true
centered: true
---
<div class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl); text-align: center;">
  The form below lands in my inbox via Web3Forms. No intake queue, no chatbot, no automated triage. Just me reading whatever you write.
</div>

<div class="stack-lg" style="max-width: 38rem; margin-inline: auto;">
  <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
    If you already know what you need:
    <a href="/book-a-call/">book a call</a>,
    <a href="/forms/bug-report/">report a bug</a>, or
    <a href="/forms/feature-request/">suggest a feature</a>.
  </p>

  <form class="form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ meta.web3formsKey }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New contact message">
    <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="{{ meta.title }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="{{ meta.url }}/thank-you/">
    <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label form__label--required" for="name">Your name</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
    </div>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label form__label--required" for="email">Email</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
    </div>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label" for="subject">Subject</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="subject" name="subject_custom" type="text" placeholder="What's this about?">
    </div>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label form__label--required" for="message">Message</label>
      <textarea class="form__textarea" id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="form__actions">
      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  {% include "partials/form-note.njk" %}
</div>
